@AgendamentoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Serviços ativos
GET {{AgendamentoApi_HostAddress}}/api/services
Accept: application/json

### Horários livres (serviceId, data AAAA-MM-DD e pessoas)
GET {{AgendamentoApi_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/available-slots?date=2026-12-01&serviceId=1&people=1
Accept: application/json

### Taxa de deslocamento a partir do CEP
GET {{AgendamentoApi_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/estimate-fee?cep=01310100
Accept: application/json

###
